[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3248.549, "timestamp": "00:54:08", "text": "。  然後，因為今天早上醒來時"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3251.309, "timestamp": "00:54:11", "text": "看到的那些事[音樂]，嗯，這讓我有點沮喪。我不知道為什麼現在連睡覺對某些噴子來說都成了問題。我還能說什麼呢？所以我想做那個東西，就是當我的直播內容在 YouTube 上離線的時候，對吧？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3257.917, "timestamp": "00:54:17", "author": "@Solar07910", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/j5v2GtdHe5Mb397GDb3gC5IoevB6pG5og12wcUK7kXFCbhNgN7R_gyWKDv5Ctf9yda4r1JuD1w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "The eyes going crazy"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3266.72, "timestamp": "00:54:26", "author": "@Solar07910", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/j5v2GtdHe5Mb397GDb3gC5IoevB6pG5og12wcUK7kXFCbhNgN7R_gyWKDv5Ctf9yda4r1JuD1w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "lol "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3267.43, "timestamp": "00:54:27", "text": "我想要一個備用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3269.43, "timestamp": "00:54:29", "text": "系統，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3283.39, "timestamp": "00:54:43", "text": "它至少可以在聊天中發出通知，例如當有新聊天或新評論時，通知用戶“Jo正在休息”，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3284.91, "timestamp": "00:54:44", "text": "等等。這樣，它就能發送一封訊息，說明Jo正在休息，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3289.349, "timestamp": "00:54:49", "text": "祝大家投票愉快等等。而且，這一切只有在其他主要工作程序（例如主軟體）發生故障時才需要"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3292.828, "timestamp": "00:54:52", "author": "@Solar07910", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/j5v2GtdHe5Mb397GDb3gC5IoevB6pG5og12wcUK7kXFCbhNgN7R_gyWKDv5Ctf9yda4r1JuD1w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "CAN’T WAIT!"}]